description: Veya UAVS scope and folder ownership — prevents off-scope AI suggestions
alwaysApply: true
---

Before coding, follow `docs/TDD.md`, `docs/STRUCTURE.md`, and `docs/WORK_SPLIT.md`.

- Edit only the folder for the active role (A: apps/web, B: data, C: apps/api/src/intent + fixtures, D: apps/api + shared).
- Do not implement features in TDD §4 Out of scope.
- Do not change `shared/types.ts` without explicit contract-change approval.
- Do not duplicate types outside `shared/types.ts`.
- One PR per role folder when possible.
